{"title":"Career Roadmap · Energy Regulatory Associate","role":"Energy Regulatory Associate","summary":"An Energy Regulatory Associate works on the legal and regulatory framework governing electricity, renewable energy, oil & gas, power generation, transmission, distribution and emerging energy technologies.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Real Estate / Infrastructure / Energy Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Energy Regulatory Associate works on the legal and regulatory framework governing electricity, renewable energy, oil & gas, power generation, transmission, distribution and emerging energy technologies."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy law"},{"text":"Regulatory law"},{"text":"Infrastructure law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Corporate law"},{"text":"Project finance awareness"},{"text":"Environmental regulation"},{"text":"Policy analysis"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"},{"text":"Commercial transactions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory research"},{"text":"Electricity-sector compliance"},{"text":"Licensing and approvals"},{"text":"Regulatory filings"},{"text":"Power purchase agreements"},{"text":"Energy-project documentation"},{"text":"Tariff matters"},{"text":"Renewable-energy regulation"},{"text":"Grid and transmission issues"},{"text":"Regulatory disputes"},{"text":"Energy-sector policy analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy companies"},{"text":"Renewable-energy developers"},{"text":"Power-generation companies"},{"text":"Transmission/distribution organizations"},{"text":"Infrastructure companies"},{"text":"Energy law firms"},{"text":"Regulatory consulting firms"},{"text":"Government/public-sector organizations"},{"text"